  letterFrom: "C\xE2bir Usta\u2019dan mektup"
  letterTitle: Uyanma vakti
  letterBody: "\xC7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131m, iki k\xF6y\xFC aya\u011Fa kald\u0131rd\u0131n.
